{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368080/extras/fb3d6e6c4bf500156c45a96f4e58581c.poster.avif?t=1770319782\" width=543 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368080/extras/fb3d6e6c4bf500156c45a96f4e58581c.webm?t=1770319782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>EvoWars is a legendary MMO brawler where you evolve from a primitive warrior into a powerful Megavolution! Join millions of players in cross-platform battles where every hit matters!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EvoWars \u2013 The Legendary Cross-Platform MMO Brawler!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8e Steam Edition unlocks permanent perks, giving you the ultimate advantage!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Faster respawn</strong> after death  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>+30% XP</strong> for defeating enemies  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>+100% XP</strong> from collecting orbs  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>+100% Rank XP</strong> every round  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>+10% Gold</strong> earned per round  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Enhanced graphics quality</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Ad-free gameplay</strong> \u2013 pure action, no interruptions!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368080/extras/d032c650803d2aed1e369763363d8a90.poster.avif?t=1770319782\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368080/extras/d032c650803d2aed1e369763363d8a90.webm?t=1770319782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368080/extras/d032c650803d2aed1e369763363d8a90.mp4?t=1770319782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Game Modes &amp; Epic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>fast-paced cross-platform multiplayer</strong> battles with up to <strong>60 players per match</strong> across various game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Classic Free-for-All</strong> \u2013 Battle for supremacy in chaotic PvP arenas!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Team Modes</strong> \u2013 Cooperate with allies for tactical victories!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc32 <strong>Monster Hunt (PvE)</strong> \u2013 Join forces to defeat terrifying creatures!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Duel</strong> \u2013 1v1 fights for ultimate bragging rights!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Easy to Play, Hard to Master!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>EvoWars</i> offers <strong>simple one-button combat</strong>, but mastering it requires <strong>strategy, precision, and skill</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing your attacks, positioning yourself wisely, and outmaneuvering opponents are the keys to <strong>becoming the ultimate warrior!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368080/extras/bbbac174c04c954666044d71adf96f4c.avif?t=1770319782\" width=607 height=327 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Join the Battle Today!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a <strong>casual player</strong> looking for quick fun or a <strong>competitive fighter</strong> aiming for the top, <i>EvoWars: New Era</i> delivers <strong>intense, action-packed battles</strong> that keep you coming back for more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Cross-platform multiplayer</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>40+ unique evolutions</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fast, skill-based combat</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Steam-exclusive premium rewards</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to evolve and conquer the battlefield?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unexpected death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368080/d1e2a8d2b387217631636cecd336e50d34f86758.jpg"},{"name":"Warm-up time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368080/b9de01d501e6da4b1f9df696bad91fa7c4f0c873.jpg"},{"name":"Team spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368080/ea7529aa627fe90880dc015087927e2fca669895.jpg"},{"name":"Orbs Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368080/2982ecc4a5430d9c7853d1dd00ae396b7afd95f7.jpg"},{"name":"The king is dead, long live the king!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368080/8a63567e4a180b8d4276b9328878c48d88d23aee.jpg"},{"name":"A great creature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368080/152e56a5a240fae9749b14c520cac2bd3d38de0c.jpg"},{"name":"I'm a troublemaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2368080/3fa6cb5edb61c